  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#54D4DB>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> DialogueController.StartDialogue
    / SkipOrNext / RestartAll, Typewriter.CharactersPerSecond \xB7 DialogueLinePool.TryPlay(tag,
    time, priority) / Finish.\n<color=#54D4DB>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    'DialogueComponent' holds the conversation (Dialogue -> Monolog -> Sentence)
    and drives the Dialogue Box's DialogueUI; its events feed the Live column. Bark
    buttons call DialogueLinePlayer directly.\n<color=#54D4DB>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b>
    Play: the conversation types itself; click the box to finish a line, click again
    to advance. Press Idle line, then Hit! - the contextual line cuts in.\n<color=#54D4DB>\xBB</color> 
    Dialogue Box / Btn_Skip or next -> DialogueController.SkipOrNext (NoCode)\n<color=#54D4DB>\xBB</color> 
    Btn_Idle line -> DialogueLinePlayer.RequestIdle \xB7 Btn_Hit! -> RequestContext(\"hit\")\n<color=#54D4DB>\xBB</color> 
    Toggles and speed -> DialogueDemoController -> DialogueController fields"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
